#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:266
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Restore the database to checkpoint #%1$s (%2$s)? EVERYTHING changed since "
"then — including changes made outside MCP — will be lost. A pre-restore "
"safety checkpoint is taken first."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan database ke checkpoint #%1$s (%2$s)? SEMUA yang berubah sejak saat "
"itu — termasuk perubahan yang dibuat di luar MCP — akan hilang. Checkpoint "
"pengaman pra-pemulihan diambil terlebih dahulu."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:267
msgid "Really sure? This rewrites every site table."
msgstr "Benar-benar yakin? Ini menulis ulang setiap tabel situs."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:267
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:270
msgid "Restore"
msgstr "Pulihkan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:272
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:275
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Hapus"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:272
msgid "Delete this checkpoint?"
msgstr "Hapus checkpoint ini?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:65 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:158
msgid "New connections: disabled"
msgstr "Koneksi baru: nonaktif"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:65
msgid "New connections: enabled"
msgstr "Koneksi baru: aktif"

#. translators: %s: countdown such as 29:59
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:69
#, php-format
msgid "%s left"
msgstr "%s tersisa"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:74
msgid "Disable now"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan sekarang"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:74 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:159
msgid "Enable for 30 minutes"
msgstr "Aktifkan selama 30 menit"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:77
msgid ""
"Step one when adding ChatGPT or a Claude app: enable this, then add the app. "
"It switches itself off after 30 minutes. API keys do not use it, and "
"connections that already exist keep working either way."
msgstr ""
"Langkah pertama saat menambahkan ChatGPT atau aplikasi Claude: aktifkan ini, "
"lalu tambahkan aplikasinya. Akan mati sendiri setelah 30 menit. Kunci API "
"tidak menggunakannya, dan koneksi yang sudah ada tetap berfungsi apa pun "
"keadaannya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:90
msgid ""
"Site actually on a public HTTPS address? Use the cloud connector instead"
msgstr ""
"Situs sebenarnya berada di alamat HTTPS publik? Gunakan konektor cloud saja"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:120
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:201
msgid ""
"<strong>Heads up:</strong> this site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS "
"address. ChatGPT connects from OpenAI's cloud, so it cannot reach local, "
"private, or non-HTTPS sites. A terminal tool works here instead, or connect "
"through a tunnel/staging URL."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Perhatian:</strong> situs ini tampaknya tidak berada di alamat HTTPS "
"publik. ChatGPT terhubung dari cloud OpenAI, sehingga tidak dapat menjangkau "
"situs lokal, privat, atau non-HTTPS. Alat terminal dapat digunakan di sini "
"sebagai gantinya, atau hubungkan melalui URL tunnel/staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:121
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:202
msgid ""
"<strong>Heads up:</strong> this site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS "
"address. The Claude apps connect from Anthropic's cloud, so they cannot "
"reach local, private, or non-HTTPS sites. A terminal tool works here "
"instead, or connect through a tunnel/staging URL."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Perhatian:</strong> situs ini tampaknya tidak berada di alamat HTTPS "
"publik. Aplikasi Claude terhubung dari cloud Anthropic, sehingga tidak dapat "
"menjangkau situs lokal, privat, atau non-HTTPS. Alat terminal dapat "
"digunakan di sini sebagai gantinya, atau hubungkan melalui URL tunnel/"
"staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:123
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so ChatGPT can connect without a terminal. No "
"access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Ini membuka proses masuk yang aman sehingga ChatGPT dapat terhubung tanpa "
"terminal. Tidak ada akses yang diberikan sampai Anda menyetujuinya di "
"browser Anda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:124
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so the Claude apps can connect without a "
"terminal. No access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Ini membuka proses masuk yang aman sehingga aplikasi Claude dapat terhubung "
"tanpa terminal. Tidak ada akses yang diberikan sampai Anda menyetujuinya di "
"browser Anda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:126
msgid "You'll paste this into ChatGPT in the next step."
msgstr "Anda akan menempelkan ini ke ChatGPT pada langkah berikutnya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:127
msgid "You'll paste this into Claude in the next step."
msgstr "Anda akan menempelkan ini ke Claude pada langkah berikutnya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:129
msgid "Add it in ChatGPT"
msgstr "Tambahkan di ChatGPT"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:130
msgid "Add it in the Claude app"
msgstr "Tambahkan di aplikasi Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:131
msgid "Add it on claude.ai"
msgstr "Tambahkan di claude.ai"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:134
msgid ""
"ChatGPT opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Review what it "
"is asking for and click <strong>Approve</strong>. To use it, open the "
"<strong>+</strong> menu in a chat, choose <strong>Developer mode</strong> "
"and select your site."
msgstr ""
"ChatGPT membuka halaman masuk di <strong>situs Anda</strong>. Tinjau apa "
"yang dimintanya dan klik <strong>Setujui</strong>. Untuk menggunakannya, "
"buka menu <strong>+</strong> di obrolan, pilih <strong>Developer mode</"
"strong>, lalu pilih situs Anda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:135
msgid ""
"Claude opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Review what it is "
"asking for and click <strong>Approve</strong>. To use it, click <strong>+</"
"strong> in a chat, open <strong>Connectors</strong> and make sure your site "
"is switched on."
msgstr ""
"Claude membuka halaman masuk di <strong>situs Anda</strong>. Tinjau apa yang "
"dimintanya dan klik <strong>Setujui</strong>. Untuk menggunakannya, klik "
"<strong>+</strong> di obrolan, buka <strong>Connectors</strong>, dan "
"pastikan situs Anda aktif."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:137
msgid ""
"Requires a ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise or Edu</strong> "
"plan, on the web. On Business and Enterprise workspaces an admin has to "
"allow Developer mode first."
msgstr ""
"Memerlukan paket ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise, atau Edu</"
"strong>, di web. Di workspace Business dan Enterprise, admin harus "
"mengizinkan Developer mode terlebih dahulu."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:138
msgid ""
"Custom connectors work on every Claude plan (Free is limited to one). On "
"Team and Enterprise, an organization owner adds the connector first under "
"<strong>Organization settings → Connectors</strong>; members then click "
"<strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Konektor kustom tersedia di semua paket Claude (Free dibatasi satu). Di Team "
"dan Enterprise, pemilik organisasi menambahkan konektor terlebih dahulu di "
"<strong>Organization settings → Connectors</strong>; anggota kemudian "
"mengklik <strong>Connect</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:155
msgid "Turn on the Desktop Connector"
msgstr "Nyalakan Desktop Connector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:159
msgid "Enable Desktop Connector"
msgstr "Aktifkan Desktop Connector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:166
msgid "Copy your connection link"
msgstr "Salin tautan koneksi Anda"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:168
msgid "Connection link"
msgstr "Tautan koneksi"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:168
msgid "Copy connector URL"
msgstr "Salin URL konektor"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:174
msgid ""
"Go to <code>chatgpt.com</code> in your browser and sign in (MCP apps work on "
"the web only)."
msgstr ""
"Buka <code>chatgpt.com</code> di browser Anda dan masuk (aplikasi MCP hanya "
"berfungsi di web)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:175
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Settings → Security and login</code> and turn on "
"<strong>Developer mode</strong> (one-time)."
msgstr ""
"Buka <code>Settings → Security and login</code> dan aktifkan "
"<strong>Developer mode</strong> (sekali saja)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:176
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Plugins</code>, click <strong>+</strong> and choose "
"<strong>Create MCP App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Buka <code>Plugins</code>, klik <strong>+</strong>, lalu pilih "
"<strong>Create MCP App</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:177
msgid ""
"Give it a name, paste the link from step 1 as the <strong>MCP server URL</"
"strong>, set Authentication to <strong>OAuth</strong>, and create it."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan dari langkah 1 sebagai <strong>MCP server URL</"
"strong>, atur Authentication ke <strong>OAuth</strong>, lalu buat "
"aplikasinya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:180
msgid "Open the <strong>Claude</strong> desktop app and sign in."
msgstr "Buka aplikasi desktop <strong>Claude</strong> dan masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:182
msgid "Go to <code>claude.ai</code> in your browser and sign in."
msgstr "Buka <code>claude.ai</code> di browser Anda dan masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:184
msgid "Go to <code>Customize → Connectors</code>."
msgstr "Buka <code>Customize → Connectors</code>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:185
msgid ""
"Click <strong>+ Add</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Klik <strong>+ Add</strong>, lalu <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:186
msgid ""
"Give it a name, paste the link from step 1, click <strong>Continue</strong> "
"and then <strong>Add</strong>. If Claude asks which OAuth client to use, "
"choose <strong>Register automatically</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan dari langkah 1, klik <strong>Continue</strong>, "
"lalu <strong>Add</strong>. Jika Claude menanyakan klien OAuth mana yang "
"digunakan, pilih <strong>Register automatically</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:191
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "Setujui akses"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:206
msgid "What works on a local site:"
msgstr "Yang berfungsi di situs lokal:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:208
msgid ""
"<strong>Terminal tools</strong> (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI) — "
"connect right now, no public URL needed. Pick one in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Alat terminal</strong> (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI) — "
"langsung terhubung, tanpa perlu URL publik. Pilih salah satu di bilah "
"samping."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:209
msgid ""
"<strong>Claude Desktop</strong> — connects through a local bridge that runs "
"on this computer. Pick it in the sidebar for instructions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Claude Desktop</strong> — terhubung melalui jembatan lokal yang "
"berjalan di komputer ini. Pilih di bilah samping untuk petunjuknya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:210
msgid ""
"<strong>claude.ai and ChatGPT</strong> — cloud-only: they need a public "
"HTTPS address. A tunnel (e.g. ngrok or Cloudflare Tunnel) works temporarily, "
"but it exposes your entire dev site to the internet while it runs, and the "
"WordPress Site Address must be set to the tunnel URL for the sign-in to work."
msgstr ""
"<strong>claude.ai dan ChatGPT</strong> — hanya cloud: keduanya butuh alamat "
"HTTPS publik. Tunnel (mis. ngrok atau Cloudflare Tunnel) bisa dipakai "
"sementara, tetapi mengekspos seluruh situs dev Anda ke internet selama "
"berjalan, dan Alamat Situs WordPress harus diubah ke URL tunnel agar proses "
"masuk berfungsi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:227
msgid ""
"This site runs on your computer, so the cloud connector cannot reach it. "
"Connect Claude Desktop through a <strong>local bridge</strong> instead: a "
"small helper that runs on this computer and forwards Claude Desktop to the "
"site. Nothing is exposed to the internet."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini berjalan di komputer Anda, sehingga konektor cloud tidak dapat "
"menjangkaunya. Hubungkan Claude Desktop melalui <strong>jembatan lokal</"
"strong>: pembantu kecil yang berjalan di komputer ini dan meneruskan Claude "
"Desktop ke situs. Tidak ada yang terekspos ke internet."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:232
msgid "Add the bridge to Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Tambahkan jembatan ke Claude Desktop"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:233
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code> (create the file if it "
"does not exist), then fully quit and restart the Claude app:"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan ini ke <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code> (buat filenya jika "
"belum ada), lalu tutup sepenuhnya dan mulai ulang aplikasi Claude:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:234
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:267
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:327
msgid "Copy setup command"
msgstr "Salin perintah penyiapan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:235
msgid ""
"macOS: <code>~/Library/Application Support/Claude/"
"claude_desktop_config.json</code> — Windows: <code>%APPDATA%"
"\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json</code>"
msgstr ""
"macOS: <code>~/Library/Application Support/Claude/"
"claude_desktop_config.json</code> — Windows: <code>%APPDATA%"
"\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json</code>"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:236
msgid ""
"Requires Node.js on this computer — the bridge is the standard open-source "
"<code>mcp-remote</code> package, started on demand via <code>npx</code>. It "
"connects only from your computer to this site."
msgstr ""
"Memerlukan Node.js di komputer ini — jembatannya adalah paket open source "
"standar <code>mcp-remote</code>, yang dijalankan sesuai kebutuhan lewat "
"<code>npx</code>. Koneksinya hanya dari komputer Anda ke situs ini."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:237
msgid ""
"Your API key is stored in plain text in that file, so prefer a <strong>read-"
"only</strong> key unless this connection needs to make changes — and revoke "
"it here when you no longer use it."
msgstr ""
"Kunci API Anda disimpan sebagai teks biasa di file tersebut, jadi utamakan "
"kunci <strong>hanya-baca</strong> kecuali koneksi ini perlu membuat "
"perubahan — dan cabut di sini saat tidak lagi digunakan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:244
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:373
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa apakah berhasil"

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:247
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open a new chat in Claude Desktop and click the tools icon — <code>%s</code> "
"should be listed. The first start can take a moment while the bridge "
"downloads."
msgstr ""
"Buka obrolan baru di Claude Desktop dan klik ikon alat — <code>%s</code> "
"seharusnya tercantum. Mulai pertama bisa memakan waktu sejenak selama "
"jembatan diunduh."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:264
msgid "Getting a certificate error?"
msgstr "Mendapat galat sertifikat?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:266
msgid ""
"Local sites usually use a self-signed certificate that AI tools reject. "
"Since this site runs on this same computer, you can use the plain "
"<code>http://</code> address instead — the connection never leaves your "
"machine. Avoid the <code>NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0</code> workaround "
"you may see online: it disables certificate checks for everything that tool "
"connects to."
msgstr ""
"Situs lokal biasanya memakai sertifikat self-signed yang ditolak alat AI. "
"Karena situs ini berjalan di komputer yang sama, Anda bisa memakai alamat "
"<code>http://</code> biasa — koneksinya tidak pernah keluar dari mesin Anda. "
"Hindari trik <code>NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0</code> yang mungkin Anda "
"lihat di internet: itu menonaktifkan pemeriksaan sertifikat untuk semua "
"koneksi alat tersebut."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:291
msgid "Create an API key"
msgstr "Buat kunci API"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:294
msgid ""
"<strong>Copy your key now</strong> — for security it will not be shown again."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Salin kunci Anda sekarang</strong> — demi keamanan, kunci tidak akan "
"ditampilkan lagi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:295
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:654
msgid "API key"
msgstr "Kunci API"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:295
msgid "Copy API key"
msgstr "Salin kunci API"

